      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hazlet%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hazlet is part of the Bayshore Regional Strategic Plan, which focuses on preserving downtowns, maritime history, and the Raritan Bayshore coastline.",
